---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Contact 33Mega | Talk to a storage engineer"
  description="Talk to 33Mega about The Atom or AI consultancy. One number to call, answered by engineers — tell us about your workflow and we'll design around it."
>
  <section class="band halftone tight">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
      <h1>Talk to an engineer.</h1>
      <p class="lead" style="max-width: 760px;">
        Tell us about your workflow — capacity, performance, growth, the systems that need to
        connect. We'll come back with a design and a straight answer. No obligation, no jargon,
        no lock-in.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band white">
    <div class="section-inner grid-2">
      <form class="pop-panel contact-form" action="mailto:33@33mega.cloud" method="post" enctype="text/plain">
        <h3 class="mt-0">Send us a message</h3>
        <label>
          Name
          <input type="text" name="name" required autocomplete="name" />
        </label>
        <label>
          Email
          <input type="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email" />
        </label>
        <label>
          Organisation
          <input type="text" name="organisation" autocomplete="organization" />
        </label>
        <label>
          What are you interested in?
          <select name="topic">
            <option>The Atom — storage platform</option>
            <option>File storage</option>
            <option>Object storage / archive</option>
            <option>Block storage</option>
            <option>AI Consultancy</option>
            <option>Something else</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label>
          Message
          <textarea name="message" rows="5" required placeholder="Tell us about the workflow: rough capacity, what connects to it, what's driving the change…"></textarea>
        </label>
        <button class="button primary" type="submit">Send message</button>
        <p class="small" style="margin: 14px 0 0;">
          This opens your email client, pre-addressed to us. Prefer to write directly?
          <a href="mailto:33@33mega.cloud">33@33mega.cloud</a>
        </p>
      </form>
      <div>
        <div class="pop-panel cyan" style="margin-bottom: 28px;">
          <h3>What happens next</h3>
          <ul class="check-list">
            <li>A storage engineer replies — not a sales sequence.</li>
            <li>We ask about the workflow before we talk about hardware.</li>
            <li>You get a design and honest sizing, in writing.</li>
            <li>If we're not the right fit, we'll say so and point you somewhere better.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="pop-panel">
          <h3>33Mega Ltd</h3>
          <p style="margin-bottom: 6px;">Cardiff, United Kingdom</p>
          <p style="margin-bottom: 0;"><a href="mailto:33@33mega.cloud">33@33mega.cloud</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .contact-form label {
    display: block;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .contact-form input,
  .contact-form select,
  .contact-form textarea {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 6px;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1rem;
    border: 2.5px solid var(--ink);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .contact-form input:focus,
  .contact-form select:focus,
  .contact-form textarea:focus {
    outline: 3px solid var(--cyan);
    outline-offset: 1px;
  }
</style>
